  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNDP-Tongji SDG Innovation Lab on Urban Disaster Resilience</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to promote sustainable urban development and enhance urban resilience and adaptability in China and facilitate international exchanges on climate-resilient cities. The project will establish a UNDP China -Tongji SDG Innovation Lab on Climate and Disaster Resilience located at the College of Civil Engineering of Tongji University. Over the course of three years, the project will enhance the Lab&#x2019;s capacities, develop joint training programme; map out cutting-edge, scalable, tech</narrative>
  </description>
